    "narrative": "Today\u2019s optimal lineup for LawDog hinges on exploiting significant SP skill deficiencies and favorable park factors. Our strongest play is **Taylor Ward** (71.19), who benefits from a high-upside matchup against a weak opposing starter (xERA 5.16) and a massive 16% park adjustment. Similarly, the stack against Zac Gallen (xERA 4.99) is the engine of the roster; **Luis Arraez** (69.53), **Matt Chapman** (68.54), and **Jung Hoo Lee** (68.02) are all mandatory starts. Their scores are bolstered not only by Gallen\u2019s vulnerability but also by the \"Slow SP Delivery\" factor, which increases our stolen base probability\u2014critical in our strategy of over-weighting speed. **Jonathan Aranda** (68.94) rounds out the top tier, benefiting from a rare combination of strong SP metrics and wind-assisted power potential in a favorable hitting environment.\n\nThe most difficult decision on the bench was **Tyler Freeman** (56.26), who narrowly missed the cut behind **Geraldo Perdomo** (57.75) and **Masyn Winn** (59.48). While **Tyler Freeman** enjoys a favorable park, the optimizer downgraded him due to a tougher opposing arm and a lack of elite, high-leverage lineup placement compared to the middle-infield options currently starting. We continue to monitor the status of **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez**, who remains sidelined on the IL, and we are proceeding cautiously with **Yainer Diaz** (50.61); while he is in the starting nine, his projected spot at the bottom of the order and a neutral matchup against a decent arm keep him as a marginal start. Managers should keep a close eye on final lineup confirmations for **Yainer Diaz**, **Jonathan Aranda**, **Luis Arraez**, **Masyn Winn**, **Geraldo Perdomo**, **Matt Chapman**, **Drew Gilbert**, **Lawrence Butler**, and **Jung Hoo Lee**, as any significant drop in batting order could further compress these efficiency scores. **Daulton Varsho** remains a high-floor play given his 92% SB potential against the opposing battery, serving as a primary target for our stolen base requirements.",
